	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas, chare frater, accepi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Expo<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sui mandata d. <persName ref="p3493">a Chaam</persName> alteri consuli <persName>Mulln<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ero</persName>; is omnia retulit ad senatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Dominum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>oro, ut hos motus componat;</foreign> dan ich sich <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>aller dingen, das es anderst nüt ist, dann ein rächte<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>r, eigensuͤchiger purenkrieg.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Si perrexerint <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illi, non alium sortientur finem quam eum, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quem rustici 1523 sortiti sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dominus servet <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nos a malo et convertat corda nostra vera poenit<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>entia ad se.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Cum legerem consuli, quae scribe<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>bas de vino <placeName ref="l648">Rhetico</placeName>, indoluit ipse dicens:</foreign> "Ich wette, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ich hätte nüt an inn begärt, diewyl er sovil <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>unruͦw von minen wägen haben muͦß."</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Excepi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ego: "Non difficulter haec agit, imo gaudet se <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tuae humanitati inservire posse et inserviet se<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>dulo et fideliter."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu ergo pro tua fide et diligentia <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cura hoc negotium, quod scio tibi curae esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><persName ref="p1884">Ludovicus</persName> meus non potuit diutius carere uxore; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>filia enim mortua mea reliquit illi 7 liberos; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ancillarum fides et diligentia quae sit vulg<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>o, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>non ignoras.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Delegit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ergo sibi uxorem pudicam, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>probam et fidelem, licet pauperem et ignobilem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Patrem habet molitorem; <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>oriundus fuit e <placeName>Durgovia</placeName>; <persName>Struplera</persName> vocatur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>familia.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Inservivit hic <persName>Kramero</persName> molitori, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>cuius filiam duxit, e qua hanc <persName>Adelheydim</persName> filiam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>suscepit natam <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Video ergo illum non quae<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>siisse uxorem bene dotatam opibus et illustrem genere <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>vel familia, sed honestis tamen ortam parentibus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et optime dotatam virtutibus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Probatur hoc eius factum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ab omnibus probis; sunt alii rursus, qui <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>dicunt: "Duxisset ille bene dotatam et nobiliorem; quam <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>facile assequi potuisset, si voluisset."</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nos vero: "<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>An ita consultum pupillis relictis?</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Satius est eam duce<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>re, quam speres fore matrem potius quam novercam."</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Haec paucis, imo multis ad tuam quaestionem.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Pridie, quam tuas accepissem, <persName>Rodolphus</persName> noster successer<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>at amplissimi senatus concordi decreto d. <persName>Sebastiano</persName><note type="margin">dazu a. R. v. Fabr.: "[Sebastianus [Guldi]beck apople[xia] periit; [su]ccessit ei [Ro]dolphus [Col]linus."]</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>solus ille senatui a scholarchis et examinatoribus <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>senatui est nominatus, quod raro factum scio; at meruit <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>hoc eius virtus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Gratulor tibi et nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominus illum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>dirigat et te servet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">23. martii 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salu<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ta amicos ordine omnes etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Remitto literas boni istius fra<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tris scriptas ad <persName ref="p8016">Thobiam</persName> nostrum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et ago tibi gratias.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Scheid jederman; dan<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>n also wylls nüt söllen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Si vero iuditium domini adest, o<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ro, ut ille nos arguat, sed non in furore suo a nobis merito et<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>c.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae fide<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>li ministro, domino meo colendo et fratri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
